      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hayden%2C_Alabama"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Settlers may have arrived as early as the 1820s, long before the town’s official founding in 1914.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
